Case angle
Case title:
Pfizer’s AI Transformation: From Pharmaceutical Giant to AI-Enabled Medicine Platform
Core case question:
Can Pfizer use AI to improve productivity, accelerate innovation, and strengthen patient engagement while managing regulatory, data, ethical, and organizational risks?
Why this is a strong MBA case
Pfizer gives you a clear digital transformation story tied to business pressure. After the COVID-era revenue surge declined, Pfizer needed to improve productivity, sharpen R&D execution, and show investors a credible path to growth. Its AI transformation is not just one tool; it touches drug discovery, clinical development, manufacturing, commercial operations, and patient engagement. Pfizer’s 2025 annual review describes AI as a key element of how the company works across the business.
